@title Commissioning: Wire test list shows whole rows and a visible scroll bar, the button stays reachable
@area Commissioning
# Commissioning > Test: the Wiring order list holds only whole rows (no half row cut off above the Write test sheet PDF button) and keeps its scroll bar visible; the summary line explains that Wire-it and the cut list count connections, so 27 drawn wires and 25 bench wires both stand.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-lesson.novo
wait 20
click_text Commissioning
wait 20
click_text Test
wait 10
expect "wires in the drawing"
expect "count connections"
expect "Write test sheet PDF"
shot wire-test-whole-rows
check_layout
scroll 120 330 -400
wait 8
shot wire-test-scrolled-to-button
expect "Write test sheet PDF"
check_layout
